flowchart TB
  Web[Application Web]
  Desk[Application Desktop Java]
  GW[Spring Cloud Gateway]
  KC[Keycloak<br/>authentification et rôles]
  EU[Eureka<br/>registre des services]
  CF[Config Server]
  MQ[(RabbitMQ)]
  Web --> GW
  Desk --> GW
  GW -. jeton .-> KC
  GW --> MS1[MS1 Cours<br/>Spring Boot]
  GW --> MS2[MS2 Quiz<br/>Spring Boot]
  GW --> MS3[MS3 Réclamations<br/>Spring Boot]
  GW --> MS4[MS4 Forum Q&A<br/>Spring Boot]
  GW --> MS5[MS5 Duels et badges<br/>FastAPI]
  MS1 --- DB1[(MongoDB)]
  MS2 --- DB2[(PostgreSQL)]
  MS3 --- DB3[(MySQL)]
  MS4 --- DB4[(MongoDB)]
  MS5 --- DB5[(PostgreSQL)]
  MS2 -- OpenFeign --> MS1
  MS5 -- OpenFeign --> MS2
  MS2 -- quiz.completed --> MQ
  MS4 -- forum.answer.accepted --> MQ
  MQ --> MS5
  MS1 -.-> EU
  MS2 -.-> EU
  MS3 -.-> EU
  MS4 -.-> EU
  MS5 -.-> EU
  MS1 -.-> CF
  MS2 -.-> CF
  MS3 -.-> CF
  MS4 -.-> CF
